sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Main)
    participant D as Directory root
    participant V as SizeCalculatorVisitor
    participant F as File report.pdf
    C->>D: accept(visitor)
    Note over D: step 1 - runtime type of the ELEMENT selects Directory.accept
    D->>V: visitDirectory(this)
    Note over V: step 2 - runtime type of the VISITOR selects its visitDirectory
    loop each child
        V->>F: accept(this)
        F->>V: visitFile(this)
        V-->>V: totalSizeInBytes += file.getSizeInBytes()
    end
    C->>V: getTotalSizeInBytes()
